{
  "about": "Vectors for jobs under limits and uncertain effects (DEC-0087), written by tools/vectors/job-limits.ts, never by hand. pause: readJobPause(answer), answer a fabric.job.get answer {job}; the grammar binds a working job whose statusMessage starts quota-exhausted. caller: jobCallerAction(answer, now), now a UTC instant; resend reuses the intent's key, never a new one; a case without now passes none. key: intentIdempotencyKey(intent); expected is a UUID of version 8 from the first 16 bytes of the SHA-256 of the intent's RFC 8785 form, or null when the intent has another shape. usage: the FAC-SEM-119 findings on one usage object, as 'code instancePath'. Every case holds in every time zone.",
